  "about": {
    "title": "About",
    "label": "Get to know me",
    "openToWorkText": "Available for opportunities",
    "descriptionHeader": "",
    "description": "<p><strong>Hi, I’m Shafin</strong>, an <em>applied AI engineer</em> based in Mumbai, India, with <strong>two years</strong> of experience building production-grade tools and AI-powered applications from the ground up. I’m currently pursuing a BS in <em>Data Science and Applications</em> at the <strong>Indian Institute of Technology Madras (IIT Madras)</strong></p><p>Recently I’ve shipped <strong>Provenance AI</strong>, a real-time safety layer for RAG pipelines, <strong>NeuralNode</strong>, a no-code workflow automation platform, <strong>NightCode</strong>, a CLI AI coding agent, and <strong>Vibe</strong>, an AI web app builder. They span <em>Next.js, React, TypeScript, Python and FastAPI</em>, with Docker and AWS for deployment, and I care about code that’s clean, type-safe and built to last.</p><p>I’m currently focused on <em>AI agents, developer tooling and scalable full-stack products</em>, and I’m open to my next AI or full-stack engineering role, whether remote or on-site, anywhere in the world.</p>",
    "image": {
      "url": "/static/images/astronaut.jpg",
      "size": {
        "width": 2252,
        "height": 2526
      }
    },
