      {
        "title": "Provenance AI",
        "slug": "provenance-ai",
        "startDate": "2026",
        "description": "Provenance AI is a real-time safety layer for RAG pipelines that I designed and built from scratch. It intercepts vector database retrievals before they reach the LLM, filtering stale and quarantined data in under 20ms across four configurable safety modes. An automated remediation engine performs semantic diff analysis and blast radius computation, with multi-channel incident alerting via Resend and Slack. I also shipped a drop-in Python SDK for zero-refactor LangChain integration with end-to-end lineage tracing. Built with a FastAPI backend, Prisma ORM and a Next.js dashboard.",
