      {
        "title": "NeuralNode",
        "slug": "neuralnode",
        "startDate": "2026",
        "description": "NeuralNode is a full-stack, no-code workflow automation platform I built from scratch. It lets users design, automate and monetize event-driven workflows through a visual drag-and-drop React Flow canvas. It supports multi-node triggers including Webhooks, Stripe events and Google Forms, alongside AI integration nodes for OpenAI, Claude and Gemini. I engineered a production-ready SaaS layer with Better Auth for authentication, Polar for subscription billing, and Sentry for error tracking and AI monitoring.",
