      {
        "title": "NightCode",
        "slug": "nightcode",
        "startDate": "2026",
        "description": "NightCode is a terminal-based AI coding agent I am architecting, with an OpenTUI and React-powered interface that lets developers plan, chat and build software directly inside their local projects. It features dual Plan and Build modes with AI SDK streaming, support for multiple AI models including Anthropic and OpenAI, and local project tools for file reading, editing and shell execution. Authentication is handled through Clerk OAuth in the browser, with Polar powering usage-based credit billing.",
