      {
        "title": "Vibe",
        "slug": "vibe",
        "startDate": "2026",
        "description": "Vibe is an AI-powered Next.js application generator I designed and developed, converting natural language prompts into production-ready, type-safe web applications. It uses Grok 4 for code generation and E2B sandboxed environments for instant live deployment previews. The scalable backend is built with tRPC for end-to-end type safety, Inngest for reliable background job processing, and Prisma ORM with PostgreSQL for data persistence. It is deployed on AWS with Docker containerization and Clerk authentication for user management.",
